  <title type="link">Delta Help</title>
  <desc>Go back to any earlier version of your files. Backups stay on this computer.</desc>

  <p>Delta keeps backups of your files, one after another, and lets you look at any of them: restore a document
  you changed by mistake, get back a folder you deleted, or browse an old backup as if it were a folder.</p>

